# MAGIC <div class="dbx">
# MAGIC <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">08</span><span class="sec-icon">🧭</span><h2>Decision cheat sheet</h2></div><div class="tbl"><table>
# MAGIC <thead>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <th>Situation</th>
# MAGIC <th>Choose</th>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC </thead>
# MAGIC <tbody>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>Same job in dev, staging and prod with different catalogs</td>
# MAGIC <td>One bundle, <strong>targets</strong> + <strong>variables</strong></td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>Developers must not overwrite each other's jobs</td>
# MAGIC <td><strong><code>mode: development</code></strong> (user-prefixed copies)</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>A prod job must not run as the engineer who deployed it</td>
# MAGIC <td><strong><code>run_as</code></strong> service principal</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>A job already exists in the UI</td>
# MAGIC <td><code>bundle generate job</code></td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>A password is needed at deploy time</td>
# MAGIC <td><code>BUNDLE_VAR_…</code> from the CI secret store</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>Prod must run exactly the tested code</td>
# MAGIC <td>Build a <strong>wheel artifact</strong> in the bundle</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>Catch config errors before deploying</td>
# MAGIC <td><code>bundle validate</code> in CI</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC </tbody>
# MAGIC </table></div>
# MAGIC </div>

